# [[.Name]]

[[if .Description]][[.Description]]

[[end]]A [Giode](https://github.com/mehran9675/giode) app for [[.PlatformNames]].

```sh
giode run                       # run on this computer
[[- if has "android"]]
giode run android               # on a connected Android device or emulator
[[- end]]
[[- if has "ios"]]
giode run ios-sim               # in the iOS simulator (macOS)
[[- end]]
[[- if has "web"]]
giode run web                   # in the browser
[[- end]]
giode build                     # every platform in giode.toml this computer can build
[[- if has "windows"]]
giode build windows-installer   # dist/windows/[[.Binary]]-<version>-setup.exe
[[- end]]
[[- if has "macos"]]
giode build dmg                 # dist/macos/[[.Name]]-<version>.dmg (macOS)
[[- end]]
[[- if has "linux"]]
giode build deb appimage        # Linux packages (Linux)
[[- end]]
[[- if has "android"]]
giode build android aab         # APK to share, AAB for Google Play
[[- end]]
[[- if has "ios"]]
giode build ios                 # .ipa for the App Store (macOS, with ios.profile)
[[- end]]
[[- if has "web"]]
giode build web                 # dist/web
[[- end]]
giode doctor                    # check the toolchains
```

App settings - name, ID, version, icon, permissions, signing - are in `giode.toml`.
Replace the placeholders in `assets/` (see `assets/README.md`) before publishing.
